Encrypted DNS setup for ${server_domain_name}
==============================================

Use any of the following to send DNS queries to the oh-my-vpn resolver.

Android (Private DNS)
---------------------
Settings -> Network & internet -> Private DNS -> Private DNS provider hostname:
  ${server_domain_name}

Browser / OS DNS-over-HTTPS (DoH)
---------------------------------
DoH URL:
  https://${server_domain_name}${doh_path}

Chrome/Edge: Settings -> Privacy and security -> Security -> Use secure DNS
-> Custom, then paste the DoH URL above.

Firefox: Settings -> Privacy & Security -> DNS over HTTPS -> Max Protection
-> Custom, then paste the DoH URL above.

DNS-over-TLS (DoT)
------------------
Endpoint:
  ${server_domain_name}:853

Note: ${server_domain_name} must resolve to ${server_public_ip}.
